### 1. GET all rooms -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms

### 2. minCapacity filter -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6

### 3. keyword filter -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?keyword=pod

### 4. combined filters -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?minCapacity=6&keyword=roof

### 5. sort by capacity -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms?sort=capacity

### 6. GET by ID -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/2

### 7. GET by ID, not found -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99

### 8. PUT -> 200
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Updated Seminar A", "capacity": 15 }

### 9. PUT, capacity too low -> 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Invalid Room", "capacity": 0 }

### 10. PUT, not found -> 404
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ghost Room", "capacity": 5 }

### 11. POST -> 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Meeting Room", "capacity": 10 }

### 12. POST, capacity too high -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Too Large Room", "capacity": 25 }

### 13. DELETE room without reservations -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/3

### 14. count -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/count

### 15. Reservations of room 1, ordered by start (expect 200, 3: Mina, Omar, Lucas)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations

### 16. Reservations of a missing room (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99/reservations

### 17. Book room 1 (expect 201 + Location: /api/reservations/6)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Kim", "startTime": "2026-10-14T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-14T11:00:00" }

### 18. Overlaps Mina's 10:00-11:00 on 6 October (expect 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-06T10:30:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T11:30:00" }

### 19. Starts exactly when Mina's ends: touching is not overlapping (expect 201 + /api/reservations/7)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-06T11:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-06T12:00:00" }

### 20. End before start (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-15T12:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-15T11:00:00" }

### 21. Book a missing room (expect 404)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/99/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservedBy": "Lee", "startTime": "2026-10-15T10:00:00", "endTime": "2026-10-15T11:00:00" }

### 22. All of Mina's reservations, with room names, in one JOIN (expect 200, 2)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations?reservedBy=Mina

### 23. Delete a room that has reservations (expect 409)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/rooms/1

### 24. Reservation by id -> 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1

### 25. Reservation that does not exist -> 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/99

### 26. Delete a reservation -> 204
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/1

### 27. Delete a reservation that does not exist -> 404
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reservations/99


